# HOLIDAY HATS — worn on the same per-frame head anchor as art/pet/hats.pet (see SPEC.md
# "Looks and hats"). Each hat is centred on the pixel BOUNDARY x = 8 (cols 7|8), mirror-symmetric
# except a deliberate flourish. Row 15 sits ON the fox's head; everything else is above it.
# At most 10 px wide (cols 3-12) and 8 px tall (rows 8-15). Hats are never recoloured by a look.

# Valentine's Day: heart bopper. A thin silver g headband and two g stalks that kink outward,
# read as one wire, and two small red hearts tilted away from each other (p shine on the upper lobe).
@frame hat_hearts
